<div class="sc-hero-band" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="light" data-fade="none" style="background:#fff;position:relative;z-index:1;overflow:hidden;"><img src="/images/circuit-board-blue.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" style="position:absolute;top:15px;right:-80px;width:300px;height:300px;opacity:0.4;pointer-events:none;z-index:0;user-select:none;transform:rotate(8deg);" /><div class="cap-section cap-section--band cap-section--hero"><div style="margin-bottom:0;">
    <div style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--hana-blue);margin-bottom:14px;">Microelectronic assembly · MEMS &amp; Sensor Assembly</div>
    <h1 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:46px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.06;letter-spacing:-0.03em;margin:0 0 18px;max-width:740px;text-wrap:balance;">MEMS and sensor packaging and assembly</h1>
    <p style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:18px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.55;max-width:660px;margin:0 0 32px;text-wrap:pretty;">Hana assembles and packages sensitive MEMS and sensor die using low-stress attach, controlled wire bonding and packaging designed to preserve the sensing function. Capabilities include cavity, open-cavity and media-access structures for pressure, motion, gas, humidity, LiDAR and optical sensor applications.</p>
    <div style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);width:100%;height:407px;"><img src="/images/capabilities/cap-microelectronic-assembly-mems-sensor-assembly-hero.webp" alt="Ported MEMS sensor package mounted on an assembled board" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center;"><div style="position:absolute;inset:auto 0 0 0;height:96px;background:linear-gradient(to top,rgba(3,10,23,0.66),rgba(3,10,23,0));"></div><div style="position:absolute;left:12px;bottom:10px;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.04em;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.92);text-transform:uppercase;">Ported MEMS sensor package on an assembled board</div></div>
    <div class="hana-spec-block" style="margin-top:18px;"><div class="hana-spec-item"><div class="hana-spec-label" style="display:block;margin-bottom:8px;">Die attach</div><div class="hana-spec-value" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:17px;">Low-stress</div></div><div class="hana-spec-item"><div class="hana-spec-label" style="display:block;margin-bottom:8px;">Packaging</div><div class="hana-spec-value" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:17px;">Cavity</div></div><div class="hana-spec-item"><div class="hana-spec-label" style="display:block;margin-bottom:8px;">Ported</div><div class="hana-spec-value" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:17px;">Media access</div></div><div class="hana-spec-item"><div class="hana-spec-label" style="display:block;margin-bottom:8px;">Fine-pitch</div><div class="hana-spec-value" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:17px;">Wire bond</div></div></div>
  </div></div></div>
<div class="sc-pillars-band" data-hana-bg="wafer" data-variant="light" data-accent="" data-fade="none" style="background:linear-gradient(120deg,#f5f7fa 35%,#d8e6f3 100%);position:relative;overflow:hidden;"><div class="cap-section cap-section--band"><div style="margin-bottom:64px;"><div style="margin-bottom:26px;"><h2 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:28px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:0;">Capability overview</h2><p style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:15.5px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.6;max-width:640px;margin:10px 0 0;">The process is designed around three requirements: mounting the die with controlled mechanical stress, creating reliable interconnects, and protecting the device without obstructing the sensing path.</p></div>
    <div class="cap-grid-3 sc-stack">
      <div class="sc-pillar" style="border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-card);overflow:hidden;background:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;">
